{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からCDが発売されるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、アンダーメンバーは\nCDの裏のジャケットに登場しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんよかったら\n手に取ってご覧ください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は前回より、少し多めに返します♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香水なに使ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→最近新しく買ったんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L'OCCITANEの、\nアニバーサリーヴァーベナオードトワレ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期間限定のハートのチャーム付き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのどの香水よりも付けやすくて\n鼻につかない香り♪\nお気に入り！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなテレビ番組は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→B.L.Tでも同じ質問があって、\nそこでは答えてない番組を挙げると\n「すべらない話」！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔の「すべらない話」を\nわざわざ調べてみることもあるくらい好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でどんな事を話したらいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→みなさんの話したい事、聞きたい事、\n何でもいいよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、私の知らない事を\n教えてもらえると、とっても嬉しい。\nだから皆さんの好きな事や、雑学や\n教えたい事が何かあれば聞きたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも何でもいいって言われるのが\n1番難しいと思う(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからブログで提案するから\n心配しなくて大丈夫だよ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメの化粧水は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→無印良品の、高保湿の化粧水！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この化粧水をたっぷりと\nひたひたになるまでつけるのがオススメ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高い化粧水をちまちまと使うより\n良いと思ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘッドホン派？イヤホン派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→断然イヤホン派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘッドホンは髪型が潰れちゃうっていう\nのもあるんだけど、\nイヤホンの、直接耳に届く感じが好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BOSEのイヤホンを愛用してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんにとっての勉強とは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→人生の幅を広げるための、\n1番身近な方法！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、何で勉強しなきゃいけないんだ〜\nって沢山思うと思うけど\n絶対勉強した方が将来役に立つと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから一緒に頑張ろうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでのコールは、「ちはる」がいい？「ちーちゃん」がいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→凄く凄く考えたんだけど、\nステージから聞いてて\n1番分かりやすいのが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ちはる」だと気付きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから皆さん、コールは\n「ちはる」で宜しくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海外旅行に行くならどこがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→エジプトに行きたいのは勿論だけど\n今行きたいのはヨーロッパ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヨーロッパの街並みや\n雰囲気を味わいたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、たくさん\n博物館や資料館、美術館に行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性は浴衣派？甚平派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→難しい質問だけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽく見えるのは浴衣！\n親しみやすいのは甚平！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも似合ってたら素敵だと思うよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張を紛らわすには何をしてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→とにかく、冷静な自分を\n心の中に置く。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着け私。落ち着け私。と..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\nできるやれるできるやれる\n君ならできるよできるやれる\nという呪文を唱える。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い時は、扇風機派？エアコン派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→扇風機派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだお家のエアコン使ってないんだ〜\n家が風通しが良くて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ前にするルーティーンは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→元祖overtureでは、背中の叩き合い。\n気合いを入れるために。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2014真夏の全国ツアーovertureでは、\n独自のダンス。\nみんなの緊張をほぐすために。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子の家に住むなら、ベッドは何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→マシュマロがいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふかふかふわふわで眠りたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マシュマロ好きだから\n寝ながら食べるかもしれないけど(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強してるときに心掛けてる事は何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→声に出しながら、\n勉強楽しい！頑張ろう！\nと言うこと。\n(周りに誰もいない場合)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れた〜出来ない〜分からない〜\nと言葉に出すと、脳が\n本当にそういう風に思ってしまうんだって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから楽しい！簡単！\nと思ったり声に出すと、\n脳が勘違いして覚えやすくなるらしい\nという話を聞いてから実践してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗記はどうやってしてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→とにかく書いて覚える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルーズリーフを縦に折って、\n縦にばーっと書いていく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、間違えた問題にはマークを\n一回一回つけて、\nマークがついたところを何回も。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのマークが沢山ついてる問題は\n苦手っていうことだから\n重点的に覚える！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで♪\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問全部に答えられなくてごめんね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問してくれた皆さんありがとう( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひぐちくんの審査員席。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豪華だぜ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友の会メンバー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかいかついメンツだぜ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中で放送されていたみたいで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知できてなくてごめんね(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「恋音と雨空」AAAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケでよく歌うんだ！\nラップの部分も頑張ってる。\n滑舌は良い方ではないけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PVも素敵だし\n歌詞も切なくて\n胸がぎゅっとなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/27/4676181/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日物凄く眠い..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あくびが止まることを知らない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、勉強出来そうなところまでやって、\n眠くなったら寝ちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、そうしよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余りにも早く寝たら、\n朝やればいいだけの話！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人は睡魔には勝てないと思ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！皆さん、睡魔に負ける前に\nどうか、質問返しの名前を\nつけてくださいな( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(↑自分勝手。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}